<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <h1 class="display-h1 text-4xl md:text-5xl">Small games deserve to be found.</h1>
    <div class="text-paper-70 leading-relaxed space-y-6 text-lg mt-8">
        <p>ArcadeBloom brings together independent browser games, game-jam projects, playful experiments and AI games. The web is full of tiny teams and solo creators making something unusual. We help their work find a curious audience.</p>
        <p>Browse by genre, explore the latest additions, or follow a game that catches your eye. Each listing introduces the idea, explains how to get started and links to the creator's original site. Third-party games live with their creators.</p>
        <h2 class="display-h2 text-paper text-3xl">Where AI fits</h2>
        <p>Some games use AI during play, for example to continue a story or respond to an answer. Others were made with help from AI tools. Our <a href="/ai-games/" class="link-inline">AI games section</a> keeps those two uses distinct and links to the creator's own explanation. One game can belong to both groups.</p>
        <h2 class="display-h2 text-paper text-3xl">What goes into a listing</h2>
        <p>We check the official source, creator details, available licence information and whether a game fits the directory. Descriptions focus on the game's idea and how to begin. Unknown licence details are marked as not declared; a listing does not grant permission to copy a game.</p>
        <p>Know something we should include? <a href="/submit/" class="link-inline">Submit a game</a>. Found an outdated link or an attribution mistake? <a href="/contact/" class="link-inline">Let us know</a>.</p>
    </div>
</div>
